  "title": "Street and Park Trees",
  "description": "An inventory of trees in Sandy City, Utah. The same tree inventory is published twice by the city, as `Parks/Grounds_and_Forestry` and as `Pub_Works/ParksDeptTrees`, both reporting the same feature count. This mirrors the Parks copy. 7,997 point features, mirrored as GeoParquet in EPSG:3566 (NAD83(HARN) / Utah Central (ftUS)) with Web Mercator vector tiles for display. See the [agent guide](AGENTS.md) for the schema, the coded-value lists and queries that run.",
